// ---- 1.0.42b prompt-editor-fit ----
// Phone: keep the prompt editor (#completion_prompt_manager_popup) inside the VISIBLE viewport. Its containing block can be <html>
// (another extension transforms <html>), so top is measured and corrected: rect.top must equal visualViewport.offsetTop + 12px.
